SUMMARY:Special Event: Nurse Blake
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 10 W. Georgia St.\, Indianapolis
DESCRIPTION:Named by The New York Times as a "genuine phenomenon\," Nurse B
 lake is bringing an all-new stand-up comedy show to comedy clubs across the
  country in 2027.\n\nFresh off multiple sold-out international tours and mo
 re than 200\,000 tickets sold\, Nurse Blake's newest show is unlike anythin
 g he's done before. Featuring brand-new material\, spontaneous moments\, an
 d his most interactive performance yet\, every night is a one-of-a-kind exp
 erience. Whether you're a nurse\, healthcare worker\, or simply someone who
 's survived a trip to the emergency room\, you'll find yourself laughing\, 
 cringing\, and saying\, "Yep...that actually happened."\n\nBefore becoming 
 one of the world's most recognizable healthcare comedians\, Nurse Blake wor
 ked in Level 1 trauma centers after earning his BSN from the University of 
 Central Florida. What started as funny videos to help nurses laugh through 
 stressful shifts has grown into a global community of millions\, sold-out t
 heaters around the world\, and the creation of NurseCon at Sea\, the world'
 s largest nursing conference at sea.\n\nNow\, he's trading theaters for the
  intimate energy of comedy clubs\, where no one is safe from becoming part 
 of the show. Expect quick wit\, unpredictable audience interaction\, outrag
 eous healthcare stories\, and the kind of laughs that feel like decompressi
 ng after the longest shift of your life.\n\nThis isn't just another stand-u
 p show. It's a night off every healthcare worker deserves.\n\nCouple's Pack
 age includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per p
 erson)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\n**The Private Skybox Suite inclu
 des up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food & Beverage voucher\, a personal server\,
  a private restroom\, and all gratuity charges.\n\nAny additional food and 
 drink costs above $400 will be billed at the end of the show. The guest cou
 nt can not exceed 10 people. All club policies and safety guidelines will b
 e enforced. Please note that the skybox is on the second floor of our showr
 oom\, and is NOT wheelchair…\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-a
 tlas/event/special-event-nurse-blake-64341/
